@startuml
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    ActorBorderColor #334155
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}

title Диаграмма последовательности: Мэтчинг участников хакатона и вступление в команду (Задание 4)

actor "Студент-разработчик\n(Артём)" as Applicant
participant "Mobile App\n(CampusMeet)" as Mobile
participant "API Gateway\n(FastAPI)" as Gateway
participant "Team Service\n& Matcher" as TeamService
database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB
actor "Капитан команды\n(Кирилл)" as Captain

Applicant -> Mobile: Переход в раздел "Биржа команд хакатона"
activate Mobile
Mobile -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/hackathons/{id}/vacancies?role=ML_ENGINEER
activate Gateway

Gateway -> DB: SELECT * FROM vacant_roles WHERE category = 'DATA_SCIENCE_ML'
activate DB
DB --> Gateway: List<VacantRole>
deactivate DB
Gateway --> Mobile: Список открытых вакансий
deactivate Gateway

Mobile --> Applicant: Карточки команд (Команда "ByteBusters", стек: PyTorch, FastAPI)

Applicant -> Mobile: Нажатие "Откликнуться" (Резюме: ссылка на GitHub, стек)
Mobile -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/teams/{id}/join-requests
activate Gateway

Gateway -> TeamService: CreateApplication(team_id, applicant_id, message)
activate TeamService
TeamService -> DB: INSERT INTO team_join_requests (...)
activate DB
DB --> TeamService: ApplicationCreated (status = 'PENDING')
deactivate DB

TeamService -> Gateway: Запрос успешно сохранен
deactivate TeamService
Gateway --> Mobile: 201 Created ("Заявка отправлена капитану")
deactivate Gateway
Mobile --> Applicant: Экран подтверждения отправки

Gateway -[#gray]> Captain: Push-уведомление капитану: "Новый отклик от Артёма (ML-инженер)"

Captain -> Gateway: PATCH /api/v1/teams/{id}/join-requests/{req_id} { status: "ACCEPTED" }
activate Gateway
Gateway -> TeamService: AcceptMember(team_id, applicant_id)
activate TeamService
TeamService -> DB: UPDATE team_members, UPDATE vacant_roles SET is_filled=true
activate DB
DB --> TeamService: MemberAdded
deactivate DB
TeamService --> Gateway: OK
deactivate TeamService
Gateway --> Captain: "Участник успешно принят в состав команды!"
deactivate Gateway

Gateway -[#gray]> Applicant: Push-уведомление: "Поздравляем! Вы приняты в команду ByteBusters"
deactivate Mobile

@enduml
